ve  this issue as well but maternity leave  is a great start and that policy has  been I think really well received and  people are looking towards that to  expand it even more and thus you see  that from front from from Steve  Schwarzman and Blackstone  yeah which seems to be the more  progressive of some of the firms then  you profiled several women though who  basically said you know I'm never gonna  reach the top I'm gonna strike out on my  own right  and have they done they've done really  well I mean we're seeing that trend kind  of increasing there are some firms where  women are the fund managers and those  are rare but something that's great  about those is there are these female  role models who are founders of the firm  or who are the bear demon deal makers  and they're able to bring in more women  at the lower level saying look I did  this you can do all right  Madeline thank you so much bringing that  story for us really eye-opening here  Madeline McMann of Bloomberg News
 

